# Manifold level 10
# The gate (stage 5n; rebuilt in 5o, decision 0031: levels of floors above floors). A hall of columns, a
# brute at its far end; west, the armory, where the launcher waits on a shelf 3 m up (two blocks to jump up
# by); east, a room with the flame lance, and a hand in it that opens the closet south (armor). North, the
# gate court: a rampart 3 m up along its west, north and east, a stair at each side, the west one broken in
# its middle (a ferry crosses); in the court, those who come out of the gatehouse. North-east, a round
# turret with the red key: it calls those who come along the north rampart. The red door, off it, opens on the
# gatehouse's upper floor, where a platform goes up and down to the winch room: the way out. Drawn as a
# plan (plans/level-4.plan, made by a script).
title The gate
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.42
sky 6.0

plan -26 -60 0

